  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPalm trees, sunshine and the beach just a short stroll away. This is the kind of home where summer feels like it lasts all year round.\r\nLight, bright and beautifully positioned to capture the sun, this coastal family home offers spacious living areas and a refreshed kitchen, creating a welcoming space for everyday family life. Step outside onto the north facing deck, the perfect spot for morning coffees, summer BBQs and entertaining friends while soaking up the sunshine.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by established palm trees, the garden brings a relaxed tropical feel, with plenty of lawn space for kids to play and pets to roam. There's even room to park the boat, making those summer adventures that much easier.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers exciting potential to create a teenage retreat, accommodate a boarder or simply provide extra room for the family to spread out.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? It's hard to beat. Take a short stroll to beautiful Waiake Beach for a morning swim or an evening walk along the sand. Torbay Village is just around the corner, while the vibrant cafés, restaurants and shops of Browns Bay are only a quick drive away.\r\n\r\nFamilies will love the convenience of being within walking distance of Torbay School, with Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College also just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nSunny, spacious and perfectly positioned for coastal living, this is a home where summer memories are waiting to be made.\r\n\r\nBring the family, bring the boat and get ready to enjoy the best of the Bays.\r\n\r\nCheck out the property video via our Team Bren & Nicole Instagram page.\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reel/Df6GjzGB0r9/?bqrl=MWdzOWJseXYwNGN5ZA==",
